WEBVTT

00:31:28.323 --> 00:31:31.197
Helen: The minute you walk
through the door, you get greeted.

00:31:31.221 --> 00:31:33.585
And then someone takes a picture of you

00:31:33.609 --> 00:31:36.482
with a printout of your name on a sheet.

00:31:36.506 --> 00:31:38.337
AG: Then the candidates are paired off

00:31:38.361 --> 00:31:40.626
and each pair has to share one desk.

00:31:40.650 --> 00:31:43.186
George: And one of the cofounders
comes in, and --

00:31:43.210 --> 00:31:46.272
Helen: And he says, "You will be observed
during that exercise."

00:31:46.296 --> 00:31:48.764
Then we get to our first task.

00:31:48.788 --> 00:31:50.700
Sara: And it's just a written exercise.

00:31:50.724 --> 00:31:53.527
You're not doing any coding
in our interview at all.

00:31:53.551 --> 00:31:55.381
It's all people skills.

00:31:55.405 --> 00:31:58.238
Lisa: And they have 20 minutes
to get through the exercise,

00:31:58.262 --> 00:31:59.484
which is not enough time.

00:31:59.508 --> 00:32:03.082
Helen: Because people might
change their behavior